    "updated_at": "2022-01-09T20:58:41Z",
    "body": "I think this might have happened in the past when vcredist (for the architecture of your starship executable) wasn't installed. Do you have it installed? You might get more error output if you launch the starship exe directly without the scoop shim.\r\nBy the way, scoop doesn't currently package ARM executables, so you might want to manually [download](https://github.com/starship/starship/releases/latest) starship without scoop to avoid translation overhead.",
